---
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { href } from '../config/url';
---

<section id="contact" class="bg-ink py-28 text-white md:py-40">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="text-headline font-bold">함께 나눌 이야기가 있다면</h2>
    <a
      href={`mailto:${site.company.email}`}
      class="mt-8 inline-block text-[clamp(1.375rem,6vw,5.5rem)] leading-[1.1] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] underline decoration-white/35 decoration-2 underline-offset-[0.18em] transition-colors duration-300 hover:decoration-white md:mt-12"
    >
      {site.company.email}
    </a>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-3 text-white/75 md:mt-16 md:flex-row md:gap-12">
      <p class="max-w-[30rem]">서비스 제휴, 웹툰·IP 사업, 언론 문의는 위 메일로 보내 주세요.</p>
      <p>
        앱 이용 문의는 <a href={href('support')} class="font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-4">고객지원</a>에서 확인해
        주세요.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
